{
  "category": "Bite Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "At first sight, POOCHYENA takes a bite at anything that moves. This POKéMON chases after prey until the victim becomes exhausted. However, it may turn tail if the prey strikes back.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "POOCHYENA is an omnivore - it will eat anything. A distinguishing feature is how large its fangs are compared to its body. This POKéMON tries to intimidate its foes by making the hair on its tail bristle out.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "It savagely threatens foes with bared fangs. It chases after fleeing targets tenaciously. It turns tail and runs, however, if the foe strikes back.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "It has a very tenacious nature. Its acute sense of smell lets it chase a chosen prey without ever losing track.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
